{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14109160","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14109160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1410916001:0":{"text":"殿下，这边的情况怎么样了？需要我帮忙吗？","source_cn":"殿下，这边的情况怎么样了？需要我帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69B132A528C390C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410916002:0":{"text":"啊……因度厄，来得正好。你那张脸似乎没破相，更好了。","source_cn":"啊……因度厄，来得正好。你那张脸似乎没破相，更好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x488BBCABA279F293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410916003:0":{"text":"刚才，我好不容易稍稍安抚了慌乱的民众。","source_cn":"刚才，我好不容易稍稍安抚了慌乱的民众。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C565E5C6365645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410916004:0":{"text":"紧接着，你这个始作俑者就如此亲密地出现在我身边搭话要帮忙，真是完美无缺的时机。","source_cn":"紧接着，你这个始作俑者就如此亲密地出现在我身边搭话要帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D2354F83FD16F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410916005:0":{"text":"我没来迟吗？幸好——","source_cn":"我没来迟吗？幸好——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC075AA688F3C20D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_statu