e_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1410916035:0":{"text":"嘿——看戏的朋友们，恭喜，你们要迎来一位比我尊贵的母亲更加难以捉摸的暴君了！","source_cn":"嘿——看戏的朋友们，恭喜，你们要迎来一位比我尊贵的母亲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4050E2D0B1F56C41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1410916036:0":{"text":"这不是我想要的！我只想揭穿谎言，为大家带来自由——","source_cn":"这不是我想要的！我只想揭穿谎言，为大家带来自由——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7CFFD4115F3A5AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1410916037:0":{"text":"但客观而言，你这段时间带来的恐慌和混乱，远远超出过往的总和了。","source_cn":"但客观而言，你这段时间带来的恐慌和混乱，远远超出过往的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x221E1A3C72574650","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1410916037":{"text":"但客观而言，你这段时间带来的恐慌和混乱，远远超出过往的总和了。","source_cn":"但客观而言，你这段时间带来的恐慌和混乱，远远超出过往的总和了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x221E1A3C72574650","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1410916038:0":{"text":"我不想为我的母亲辩解，很多时候，好的动机，并不代表能有好的结果。","source_cn":"我不想为我的母亲辩解，很多时候，好的动机，并不代表能有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6DDFB1BE63A1D8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s