"},"say:49:1410916044:0":{"text":"那么，既然你还不打算向我递交辞呈，我就再派给你一个任务吧。","source_cn":"那么，既然你还不打算向我递交辞呈，我就再派给你一个任务吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC52772A35B0BC89E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1410916045:0":{"text":"我命令你——去地表看看，看看那究竟是怎样的地方。","source_cn":"我命令你——去地表看看，看看那究竟是怎样的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35998C700CEBC56C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1410916046:0":{"text":"那里一定有很多美好的东西，也一定会有很多谎言和丑恶……就像萨洛克兰一样。","source_cn":"那里一定有很多美好的东西，也一定会有很多谎言和丑恶……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660EB99D07637BB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1410916047:0":{"text":"但一定，也有与萨洛克兰不一样的地方。这里的秩序由我维护，你去吧。","source_cn":"但一定，也有与萨洛克兰不一样的地方。这里的秩序由我维护...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6710909B188A7818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1410916048:0":{"text":"回来后，要把你的见闻原原本本地告诉我们——无论是好的，不好的，一样的，还是不一样的。","source_cn":"回来后，要把你的见闻原原本本地告诉我们——无论是好的，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3D18AE43C32799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1410916049:0":{"text":"……明白。\n多谢你